@startuml C4_Search_Operation_Plans_Process_View
title C4 – Operation Plan Search (Detailed Flow)
hide footbox

actor "Frontoffice SPA" as Spa
participant "HttpClient" as HttpClient
participant "TodoApi OemProxyController" as Controller
participant "OemClient" as Client
participant "OEM OperationPlansController" as OemController
participant "OperationPlansService" as Service
participant "OperationPlanRepository" as Repository
participant "Database" as Database

Spa -> HttpClient : GET /api/oem/operation-plans?from=...&to=...
HttpClient -> Controller : Send request with cookies/JWT
Controller -> Client : Build OEM request
Client -> OemController : GET /operation-plans?from=...&to=...
OemController -> Service : findAll(filter)
Service -> Repository : find(filter)
Repository -> Database : SELECT ... WHERE target_day BETWEEN ...
Database --> Repository : Result rows
Repository --> Service : Entities list
Service -> Service : map to DTOs (include vessel, dock, timings)
Service --> OemController : DTO array
OemController --> Client : HTTP 200 + body
Client --> Controller : Relay response
Controller --> HttpClient : JSON array
HttpClient --> Spa : Provide response
Spa -> Spa : Sort/paginate, update UI state

@enduml
